{"h":["<div class=\"tk-inline\" data-side=\"abhinava\" data-label=\"अभिनवनारायणीया\"><span class=\"tk-ava\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_0\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अनुवृत्तस्यैव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अनुवृत्तस्य एव</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_1\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मृदादेः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मृद्-आदेः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_2\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">कारणत्वदर्शनात्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">कारणत्व-दर्शनात्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_3\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अननुवृत्तस्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अन्-अनुवृत्तस्य</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_4\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तन्त्वादेः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तन्तु-आदेः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_5\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">घटादिकारणत्वादर्शनान्नैवमित्याह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">घट-आदि-कारणत्व-अदर्शनात् न एवम् इति आह</span></span>—</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"न त्वसद्वादिनामिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_6\" data-g=\"abhinava\">न</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_7\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">त्वसद्वादिनामि<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">तु असत्-वादिनाम् <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_8\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_9\" data-g=\"abhinava\">असतः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_10\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सदुत्पत्तिसम्भावनाहेतुभूतः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सत्-उत्पत्ति-सम्भावना-हेतु-भूतः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_11\" data-g=\"abhinava2\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अननुवृत्तस्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अन्-अनुवृत्तस्य</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_12\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">कारणत्वसाधको</span><span class=\"bhsp\">कारणत्व-साधकः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_13\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">दृष्टान्तो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">दृष्टान्तः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_14\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नास्तीत्यर्थः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न अस्ति इति अर्थः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_15\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_16\" data-g=\"abhinava\">अनुवृत्तस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_17\" data-g=\"abhinava\">कारणत्वे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_18\" data-g=\"abhinava\">तु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_19\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सोऽस्तीत्याह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सः अस्ति इति आह</span></span>-</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"मृदिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_20\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मृदि<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">मृद् <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_21\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_22\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स्यादेतदेवं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">स्यात् एतत् एवम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_23\" data-g=\"abhinava\">यदि</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_24\" data-g=\"abhinava\">मृदः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_25\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">कारणत्वं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">कारणत्वम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_26\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तदेव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत् एव</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_27\" data-g=\"abhinava\">तु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_28\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">कथमित्याशङ्क्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">कथम् इति आशङ्क्य</span></span>, <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_29\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अन्वयव्यतिरेकौ</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अन्वय-व्यतिरेकौ</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_30\" data-g=\"abhinava\">दर्शयति</span></span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"तद्भाव इति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_31\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तद्भाव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तद्-भावः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_32\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_33\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_34\" data-g=\"abhinava\">न</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_35\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">केवलमसतः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">केवलम् असतः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_36\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सदुत्पत्तौ</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सत्-उत्पत्तौ</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_37\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">साधकाभावः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">साधक-अभावः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_38\" data-g=\"abhinava\">किन्तु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_39\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">बाधकमपीत्याह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">बाधकम् अपि इति आह</span></span>-</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"यद्यभावादिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_40\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">यद्यभावादि<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">यदि अभावात् <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_41\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_42\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">बाधकान्तरमप्याह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">बाधक-अन्तरम् अपि आह</span></span>–</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"अभावशब्देति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_43\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अभावशब्दे<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">अभाव-शब्द <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_44\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_45\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">घटादिकार्ये</span><span class=\"bhsp\">घट-आदि-कार्ये</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_46\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मृच्छब्दबुद्ध्योरनुवृत्तिदर्शनादिति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मृद्-शब्द-बुद्ध्योः अनुवृत्ति-दर्शनात् इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_47\" data-g=\"abhinava\">भावः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_48\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_49\" data-g=\"abhinava2\">असतः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_50\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सत्कारणत्वनिराकरणमुपसंहरति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सत्-कारणत्व-निराकरणम् उपसंहरति</span></span>-</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_51\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अत</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अतः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_52\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_53\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_54\" data-g=\"abhinava\">अनुवृत्तस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_55\" data-g=\"abhinava\">कारणत्वे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_56\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मृद्घटो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मृद्-घटः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_57\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">दृष्टान्त</span><span class=\"bhsp\">दृष्टान्तः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_58\" data-g=\"abhinava\">उक्तः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_59\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_60\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नोपपद्यत</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न उपपद्यते</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_61\" data-g=\"abhinava\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_62\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विज्ञानवादिशङ्कामनुवदति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विज्ञानवादि-शङ्काम् अनुवदति</span></span> –</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"यदपीति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_63\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">यदपी<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">यत् अपि <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_64\">।</span></span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"निमित्तमिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_65\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">निमित्तमि<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">निमित्तम् <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_66\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पूर्ववर्तीत्यर्थः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पूर्ववर्ती इति अर्थः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_67\">।</span> <span class=\"w dm-conc\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_68\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">यद्यपि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">यदि अपि</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_69\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">प्रत्यक्षादिप्रमाणसिद्धस्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">प्रत्यक्ष-आदि-प्रमाण-सिद्धस्य</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_70\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">बाह्यपदार्थस्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">बाह्य-पदार्थस्य</span></span> '<span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_71\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नाभाव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न अभावः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_72\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">उपलब्धेरि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">उपलब्धेः इ</span></span>’<span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_73\" data-g=\"abhinava\">ति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_74\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">न्यायसिद्धत्वेन</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न्याय-सिद्धत्वेन</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_75\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तन्निराकरणा</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत्-निराकरण-अ</span></span> (<span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_76\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नुपहतस्यैव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">नुपहतस्य एव</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_77\">।</span>) [<span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_78\" data-g=\"abhinava\">नुकूल</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_79\" data-g=\"abhinava\">एव</span>] <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_80\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मृदादिदृष्टान्तः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मृद्-आदि-दृष्टान्तः</span></span>, <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_81\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अभ्युपगमेऽपि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अभ्युपगमे अपि</span></span></span></div>","<div class=\"side-zone\" data-side=\"abhinava\"><div class=\"zlabel\">अभिनवनारायणीया</div><div class=\"tika dv\"><div class=\"tk\"><span class=\"tk-ava\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_0\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अनुवृत्तस्यैव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अनुवृत्तस्य एव</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_1\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मृदादेः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मृद्-आदेः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_2\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">कारणत्वदर्शनात्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">कारणत्व-दर्शनात्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_3\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अननुवृत्तस्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अन्-अनुवृत्तस्य</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_4\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तन्त्वादेः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तन्तु-आदेः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_5\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">घटादिकारणत्वादर्शनान्नैवमित्याह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">घट-आदि-कारणत्व-अदर्शनात् न एवम् इति आह</span></span>—</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"न त्वसद्वादिनामिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_6\" data-g=\"abhinava\">न</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_7\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">त्वसद्वादिनामि<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">तु असत्-वादिनाम् <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_8\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_9\" data-g=\"abhinava\">असतः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_10\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सदुत्पत्तिसम्भावनाहेतुभूतः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सत्-उत्पत्ति-सम्भावना-हेतु-भूतः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_11\" data-g=\"abhinava2\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अननुवृत्तस्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अन्-अनुवृत्तस्य</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_12\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">कारणत्वसाधको</span><span class=\"bhsp\">कारणत्व-साधकः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_13\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">दृष्टान्तो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">दृष्टान्तः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_14\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नास्तीत्यर्थः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न अस्ति इति अर्थः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_15\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_16\" data-g=\"abhinava\">अनुवृत्तस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_17\" data-g=\"abhinava\">कारणत्वे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_18\" data-g=\"abhinava\">तु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_19\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सोऽस्तीत्याह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सः अस्ति इति आह</span></span>-</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"मृदिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_20\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मृदि<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">मृद् <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_21\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_22\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स्यादेतदेवं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">स्यात् एतत् एवम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_23\" data-g=\"abhinava\">यदि</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_24\" data-g=\"abhinava\">मृदः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_25\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">कारणत्वं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">कारणत्वम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_26\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तदेव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत् एव</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_27\" data-g=\"abhinava\">तु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_28\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">कथमित्याशङ्क्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">कथम् इति आशङ्क्य</span></span>, <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_29\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अन्वयव्यतिरेकौ</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अन्वय-व्यतिरेकौ</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_30\" data-g=\"abhinava\">दर्शयति</span></span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"तद्भाव इति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_31\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तद्भाव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तद्-भावः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_32\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_33\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_34\" data-g=\"abhinava\">न</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_35\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">केवलमसतः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">केवलम् असतः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_36\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सदुत्पत्तौ</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सत्-उत्पत्तौ</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_37\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">साधकाभावः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">साधक-अभावः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_38\" data-g=\"abhinava\">किन्तु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_39\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">बाधकमपीत्याह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">बाधकम् अपि इति आह</span></span>-</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"यद्यभावादिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_40\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">यद्यभावादि<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">यदि अभावात् <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_41\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_42\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">बाधकान्तरमप्याह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">बाधक-अन्तरम् अपि आह</span></span>–</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"अभावशब्देति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_43\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अभावशब्दे<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">अभाव-शब्द <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_44\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_45\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">घटादिकार्ये</span><span class=\"bhsp\">घट-आदि-कार्ये</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_46\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मृच्छब्दबुद्ध्योरनुवृत्तिदर्शनादिति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मृद्-शब्द-बुद्ध्योः अनुवृत्ति-दर्शनात् इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_47\" data-g=\"abhinava\">भावः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_48\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_49\" data-g=\"abhinava2\">असतः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_50\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सत्कारणत्वनिराकरणमुपसंहरति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सत्-कारणत्व-निराकरणम् उपसंहरति</span></span>-</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_51\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अत</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अतः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_52\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_53\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_54\" data-g=\"abhinava\">अनुवृत्तस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_55\" data-g=\"abhinava\">कारणत्वे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_56\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मृद्घटो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मृद्-घटः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_57\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">दृष्टान्त</span><span class=\"bhsp\">दृष्टान्तः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_58\" data-g=\"abhinava\">उक्तः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_59\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_60\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नोपपद्यत</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न उपपद्यते</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_61\" data-g=\"abhinava\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_62\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विज्ञानवादिशङ्कामनुवदति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विज्ञानवादि-शङ्काम् अनुवदति</span></span> –</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"यदपीति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_63\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">यदपी<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">यत् अपि <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_64\">।</span></span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"निमित्तमिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_65\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">निमित्तमि<span class=\"tk-vy\">ति</span></span><span class=\"bhsp\">निमित्तम् <span class=\"tk-vy\">इति</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_66\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पूर्ववर्तीत्यर्थः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पूर्ववर्ती इति अर्थः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_67\">।</span> <span class=\"w dm-conc\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_68\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">यद्यपि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">यदि अपि</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_69\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">प्रत्यक्षादिप्रमाणसिद्धस्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">प्रत्यक्ष-आदि-प्रमाण-सिद्धस्य</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_70\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">बाह्यपदार्थस्य</span><span class=\"bhsp\">बाह्य-पदार्थस्य</span></span> '<span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_71\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नाभाव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न अभावः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_72\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">उपलब्धेरि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">उपलब्धेः इ</span></span>’<span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_73\" data-g=\"abhinava\">ति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_74\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">न्यायसिद्धत्वेन</span><span class=\"bhsp\">न्याय-सिद्धत्वेन</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_75\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तन्निराकरणा</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत्-निराकरण-अ</span></span> (<span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_76\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">नुपहतस्यैव</span><span class=\"bhsp\">नुपहतस्य एव</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_77\">।</span>) [<span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_78\" data-g=\"abhinava\">नुकूल</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_79\" data-g=\"abhinava\">एव</span>] <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_80\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मृदादिदृष्टान्तः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मृद्-आदि-दृष्टान्तः</span></span>, <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_81\" data-g=\"abhinava\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अभ्युपगमेऽपि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अभ्युपगमे अपि</span></span></span></div></div></div>"],"gt":{"अनुवृत्तस्यैव":["अनुवृत्त (अनु+√वृत् + क्त) · षष्ठी·एक·नपुं + एव · अव्यय","of that which persists alone","अनुवृत्तस्य + एव"],"मृदादेः":["मृद्-आदि (बहुव्रीहि) · षष्ठी·एक·नपुं","of clay, etc.","मृद्-आदेः","",[["मृद्|",1],["आदि||bv",1]]],"कारणत्वदर्शनात्":["कारणत्व-दर्शन (तत्पुरुष) · पञ्चमी·एक·नपुं","from seeing causality","कारणत्व-दर्शनात्","",[["कारणत्व|",1],["दर्शन|",1]]],"अननुवृत्तस्य":["अन्-अनुवृत्त (नञ्-क्त) · षष्ठी·एक·पुं","of that which does not persist","अन्-अनुवृत्तस्य"],"तन्त्वादेः":["तन्तु-आदि (बहुव्रीहि) · षष्ठी·एक·पुं","of threads, etc.","तन्तु-आदेः","",[["तन्तु|",1],["आदि||bv",1]]],"घटादिकारणत्वादर्शनान्नैवमित्याह":["घट-आदि-कारणत्व-अदर्शन (तत्पुरुष) · पञ्चमी·एक·नपुं + न · अव्यय + एवम् · अव्यय + इति · अव्यय + √ब्रू (आह-आदेश) · लट्·प्रथम·एक·परस्मैपद","because non-persistence is not seen as cause of pot etc.; not so, he says","घट-आदि-कारणत्व-अदर्शनात् + न + एवम् + इति + आह","",[["घट|",1],["आदि|",1],["कारणत्व|",1],["अदर्शन|",1]]],"न":["न · अव्यय (निषेधार्थक)","not, no",""],"त्वसद्वादिनामिति":["तु · अव्यय + असत्-वादिन् (उपपद) · षष्ठी·बहु·पुं + इति · अव्यय","however, for those who assert the non-existent; thus","तु + असत्-वादिनाम् + इति","",[["असत्|",1],["वादिन्|",1]]],"असतः":["अ-सत् · पञ्चमी·एक·नपुं","from the non-existent","","",[["असत्|न"]]],"सदुत्पत्तिसम्भावनाहेतुभूतः":["सत्-उत्पत्ति-सम्भावना-हेतु-भूत (तत्पुरुष) · प्रथमा·एक·पुं","serving as the basis for the possibility of origination of the existent","सत्-उत्पत्ति-सम्भावना-हेतु-भूतः","",[["सत्|",1],["उत्पत्ति|",1],["हेतु|",1],["भूत|",1]]],"कारणत्वसाधको":["कारणत्व-साधक (तत्पुरुष) · प्रथमा·एक·पुं","establishing causality","कारणत्व-साधकः","",[["कारणत्व|",1],["साधक|",1]]],"दृष्टान्तो":["दृष्टान्त · प्रथमा·एक·पुं","an example","दृष्टान्तः","",[["दृष्टान्त|पुं"]]],"नास्तीत्यर्थः":["न · अव्यय + √अस् · लट्·प्रथम·एक·परस्मैपद + इति · अव्यय + अर्थ · प्रथमा·एक·पुं","does not exist; such is the meaning","न + अस्ति + इति + अर्थः","",[["अर्थ|पुं",2]]],"अनुवृत्तस्य":["अनुवृत्त (अनु+√वृत् + क्त) · षष्ठी·एक·नपुं","of that which persists",""],"कारणत्वे":["कारणत्व (त्व-प्रत्यय) · सप्तमी·एक·नपुं","in the matter of being the cause",""],"तु":["तु · अव्यय (विशेषार्थक)","but, however",""],"सोऽस्तीत्याह":["तद् · प्रथमा·एक·पुं + √अस् · लट्·प्रथम·एक·परस्मैपद + इति · अव्यय + √ब्रू (आह-आदेश) · लट्·प्रथम·एक·परस्मैपद","that does exist, he says","सः + अस्ति + इति + आह"],"मृदिति":["मृद् स्त्री·प्रथमा·एक + इति · अव्यय","'clay' — thus","मृद् + इति","",[["मृद्|स्त्री",2]]],"स्यादेतदेवं":["√भू · विधिलिङ्·प्रथम·एक·परस्मैपद + एतद् · प्रथमा·एक·नपुं + एवम् · अव्यय","this would be so","स्यात् + एतत् + एवम्"],"यदि":["यदि · अव्यय (शर्तार्थक)","if",""],"मृदः":["मृद् · षष्ठी·एक·स्त्री","of clay","","",[["मृद्|स्त्री"]]],"कारणत्वं":["कारणत्व (त्व-प्रत्यय) · प्रथमा·एक·नपुं","causality","कारणत्वम्"],"तदेव":["तद् · प्रथमा·एक·नपुं + एव · अव्यय","that itself","तत् + एव"],"कथमित्याशङ्क्य":["कथम् · अव्यय + इति · अव्यय + आ+√शङ्क् + ल्यप् · अव्यय","how so? thus objecting","कथम् + इति + आशङ्क्य"],"अन्वयव्यतिरेकौ":["अन्वय-व्यतिरेक (इतरेतरद्वन्द्व) · द्वितीया·द्वि·पुं","positive and negative concomitances","अन्वय-व्यतिरेकौ","",[["अन्वय|",1],["व्यतिरेक|",1]]],"दर्शयति":["√दृश् (णिच्) · लट्·प्रथमपुरुष·एक·परस्मैपद","shows, points out",""],"तद्भाव":["तद्-भाव (षष्ठीतत्पुरुष) · प्रथमा·एक·पुं","its presence","तद्-भावः","",[["तद्भाव|पुं"]]],"इति":["इति · अव्यय (उद्धरण/समाप्ति-सूचक)","thus, so (quotative)",""],"केवलमसतः":["केवलम् · अव्यय + असत् · पञ्चमी·एक·नपुं","only; of the non-existent","केवलम् + असतः","",[["असत्|न",2]]],"सदुत्पत्तौ":["सत्-उत्पत्ति (षष्ठीतत्पुरुष) · सप्तमी·एक·स्त्री","in the arising of the existent","सत्-उत्पत्तौ","",[["सत्|",1],["उत्पत्ति|",1]]],"साधकाभावः":["साधक-अभाव (तत्पुरुष) · प्रथमा·एक·पुं","absence of an establishing factor","साधक-अभावः","",[["साधक|",1],["अभाव|",1]]],"किन्तु":["किन्तु · अव्यय (विरोध)","but, however",""],"बाधकमपीत्याह":["बाधक · प्रथमा·एक·नपुं + अपि · अव्यय + इति · अव्यय + √ब्रू (आह-आदेश) · लट्·प्रथम·एक·परस्मैपद","there is also a subverting factor, he says","बाधकम् + अपि + इति + आह","",[["बाधक|न",2]]],"यद्यभावादिति":["यदि · अव्यय + अभाव · पञ्चमी·एक·पुं + इति · अव्यय","if from non-existence; thus","यदि + अभावात् + इति","",[["अभाव|पुं",2]]],"बाधकान्तरमप्याह":["बाधक-अन्तर (कर्मधारय) · द्वितीया·एक·नपुं + अपि · अव्यय + √ब्रू (आह-आदेश) · लट्·प्रथम·एक·परस्मैपद","he also states another counter-argument","बाधक-अन्तरम् + अपि + आह","",[["बाधक|",1],["अन्तर|",1]]],"अभावशब्देति":["अभाव-शब्द (तत्पुरुष) · प्रथमा·एक·पुं + इति · अव्यय","the word 'abhāva'; thus","अभाव-शब्द + इति","",[["अभाव|",1],["शब्द|",1]]],"घटादिकार्ये":["घट-आदि-कार्य (तत्पुरुष) · सप्तमी·एक·नपुं","in the effect such as pot","घट-आदि-कार्ये","",[["घट|",1],["आदि|",1],["कार्य|",1]]],"मृच्छब्दबुद्ध्योरनुवृत्तिदर्शनादिति":["मृद्-शब्द-बुद्धि (द्वन्